adw-gtk-theme (6.5-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * adw-gtk3-dark: the GTK 4 dark colours apply without the
    prefers-color-scheme media query, which GTK before 4.20 (Debian 13)
    skips, so GTK 4 apps without libadwaita (pavucontrol) are dark too.

